{"meta":{"id":"security","category":"aide/common-rules","title":"보안","subtitle":"(env·gitignore·dockerignore)","summary":"env 구조, gitignore/dockerignore 등 민감정보 관리 규칙","tags":["aide","규칙","보안","env"],"color":"indigo","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-linux-files","updatedAt":"2026-09-05"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-100/70 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-60 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n<div class=\"absolute -bottom-16 -left-16 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-50/80 rounded-full blur-2xl opacity-80 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-indigo-100/80\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\n    <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 border border-indigo-200/50 tracking-wider\">\n      <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></span>\n      1-rules\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide uppercase text-stone-400 font-serif\">aide Common Rules</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">\n    보안 <span class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-normal text-indigo-400 font-serif\">(env·gitignore·dockerignore)</span>\n  </h1>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-indigo-50/50 border border-indigo-100/70 rounded-xl p-3\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n      <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900\">문서 범위:</strong> 민감정보 관리 — env 구조, gitignore, dockerignore\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5 border-b border-stone-100\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div>\n    <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">env 구조</h2>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">실제 값은 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">.env</code>, 커밋하는 건 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">.env.example</code>(키 이름만, 값은 비움/더미) — .env는 반드시 gitignore</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">환경별로 분리 — <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">.env.development</code>, <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">.env.production</code> 등. 하나에 다 몰아넣지 않는다</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">여러 환경을 한 저장소에서 같이 버전관리해야 하면(대규모 우산 레포 등) 평문 대신 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">암호화한 .env.enc</strong>를 커밋하고 복호화 스크립트를 함께 제공</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5 border-b border-stone-100\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div>\n    <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">gitignore / dockerignore</h2>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">기본 포함: .env*(예외 .env.example), node_modules/, __pycache__/, venv/, 빌드 산출물, IDE 설정, 로그, OS 파일, zip/bak/tmp 등</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">매번 새로 쓰지 말고 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">3-modules/1-ignore의 .gitignore/.dockerignore를 그대로 복사</strong>해서 시작, 필요한 항목만 프로젝트 파일에서 추가</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">dockerignore는 gitignore와 별개로 관리 — git엔 필요 없어도 빌드 컨텍스트에서 빼야 하는 것과, git엔 있어도 이미지엔 넣으면 안 되는 것(.env, .git/)이 다름</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-2 bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200/80 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-4.5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2.5\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-500\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n      <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <h3 class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-900\">공통 원칙</h3>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">시크릿(API 키, 비밀번호, 토큰)은 코드에 하드코딩하지 않는다 — 전부 env 변수로 뺀다</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">커밋 전에 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">git status</code>/<code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">git diff</code>로 실수로 포함된 민감 파일이 없는지 확인한다</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-5 pt-3 border-t border-stone-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-stone-400\">\n  <span>aide Common Rules</span>\n  <span>보안</span>\n</div>\n","path":"aide/common-rules/security","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"aide","title":"aide","path":"aide"},{"id":"common-rules","title":"1-rules (공통 규칙)","path":"aide/common-rules"}],"hasImage":false}